    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Catalyaah Iyo Yoo'aash",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Catalyaah oo ahayd Axasyaah hooyadiis markay aragtay in wiilkeedii dhintay ayay kacday oo wada baabbi'isay farcankii reer boqor oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yehooshebac oo ahayd Boqor Yooraam gabadhiisii, oo Axasyaahna walaashiis ahayd, waxay la tagtay Axasyaah wiilkiisii Yoo'aash, oo ay ka dhex xadday wiilashii boqorka ee la laayay, isagii iyo tii xannaanayn jirtayba, oo waxay gelisay qolka la seexdo, oo iyana Catalyaah way ka qariyeen, sidaas daraaddeed isagii lama dilin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna iyadii buu la joogay, oo wuxuu kula qarsoonaa gurigii Rabbiga intii lix sannadood ah; oo dalkiina waxaa u talisay Catalyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sannaddii toddobaad ayaa Yehooyaadaac u cid diray oo isugu yeedhay boqol u taliyayaashii u taliyey reer Kaarii iyo askartii ordi jirtay, oo gurigii Rabbiga ayuu keensaday; markaasuu axdi la dhigtay oo iyagii gurigii Rabbiga gudihiisa ku dhaariyey, dabadeedna wuxuu tusay wiilkii boqorka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuuna amray oo ku yidhi, Idinku sidan yeela: meeshiinna saddexaad ee sabtida gashaa waa inay guriga boqorka ilaaliyaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo meel saddexaadna iridda Suur ha joogeen; meel saddexaadna ha joogeen iridda askartii ordi jirtay ka dambaysa; sidaas waa inaad guriga u ilaalisaan oo aad wax uga celisaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadiinna guuto oo ah kulli inta sabtida baxda oo dhanba waa inay guriga Rabbiga ilaaliyaan iyagoo boqorka ku wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo idinku waxaad isku wareejisaan boqorka idinkoo nin waluba hubkiisa gacanta ku haysto, oo midkii safafka soo dhex gala ha la dilo, oo boqorkana la jira markuu baxayo iyo markuu soo gelayoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqol u taliyayaashiina way yeeleen wixii wadaadkii Yehooyaadaac ahaa ku amray oo dhan; oo nin waluba wuxuu kaxeeyey raggiisii sabtida geli lahaa iyo kuwii sabtida bixi lahaa, oo waxay u yimaadeen wadaadkii Yehooyaadaac ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa wadaadkii wuxuu boqol u taliyayaashii siiyey warmihii iyo gaashaammadii Boqor Daa'uud lahaa oo guriga Rabbiga yiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay askartii isagoo nin waluba hubkiisii gacanta ku haysto istaageen guriga dhankiisii midig iyo ilaa dhankiisii bidix iyo meeshii allabariga agteeda iyo guriga agtiisa, oo boqorkii bayna isku wareejiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wiilkii boqorka soo bixiyey, oo wuxuu madaxa u saaray taajkii, markhaatifurkiina wuu siiyey; oo waxay ka dhigeen boqor, wayna subkeen, kolkaasay u sacbiyeen, oo waxay yidhaahdeen, Boqorku ha noolaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Catalyaahna markay qayladii askarta iyo dadka maqashay ayay dadkii ugu timid gurigii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eeg, boqorku wuxuu taagnaa tiirka agtiisa siday caadadu ahayd, oo saraakiishii iyo kuwii turumbada watayna boqorkay ag taagnaayeen; oo dadkii waddanka oo dhammuna way reyreeyeen oo turumbooyin afuufeen. Markaasaa Catalyaah dharkeedii iska jeexjeexday oo waxay ku qaylisay, Waa fallaagow, waa fallaagow! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa wadaadkii Yehooyaadaac ahaa amray boqol u taliyayaashii ciidanka u sarreeyey, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Iyada soo bixiya oo safafka soo dhex mariya, oo kii soo raacana seef ku dila, waayo, wadaadku wuxuu yidhi, Iyada yaan lagu dhex dilin guriga Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed iyadii meel bay u banneeyeen, markaasay tagtay marinkii ay farduhu gurigii boqorka u mari jireen, oo halkaasaa lagu dilay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yehooyaadaac sameeyey axdi u dhexeeya Rabbiga iyo boqorka iyo dadkaba inay iyagu ahaadaan Rabbiga dadkiisa, oo haddana wuxuu dhex dhigay boqorkii iyo dadkii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabadeedna dadkii waddanka oo dhammu waxay tageen gurigii Bacal, oo way dumiyeen, oo meelihiisii allabariga iyo sanamyadiisii oo dhanna way wada burburiyeen, oo Mataan oo ahaa Bacal wadaadkiisiina waxay ku dileen meelihii allabariga hortooda. Oo wadaadkii wuxuu doortay kuwa gurigii Rabbiga u taliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu kaxeeyey boqol u taliyayaashii iyo kuwii reer Kaarii, iyo askartii ordi jirtay, iyo dadkii waddanka oo dhanba, oo waxay boqorkii ka soo dejiyeen gurigii Rabbiga, oo intay jidkii iridda waardiyayaasha soo mariyeen ayay keeneen gurigii boqorka. Oo isna wuxuu ku fadhiistay carshigii boqorrada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dadkii waddanka oo dhammu way wada reyreeyeen, oo magaaladiina way xasilloonayd, oo Catalyaahna gurigii boqorka agtiisa ayay seef ku dileen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yehoo'aashna toddoba sannadood buu jiray markuu boqor noqday.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
